WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.040
Courage is an external thing.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.140
So I have met people who literally have courage.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.990
What we would call courage.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.501
They have put their lives on the line,

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:15.870
they have thrown themselves into harms way

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.429
in order to save the life of someone else.

00:00:18.429 --> 00:00:21.556
They have done something that we would consider mad,

00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:24.900
that violates all tenets of survival ...

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.339
so that someone else will survive.

00:00:28.339 --> 00:00:29.000
Courage.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.720
Real courage.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.440
And I've talked to them and I always say,

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.370
"Why did you do it?"

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.590
You've got a wife, you've got kids.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.570
Why would you do that?

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.150
And they all give me the same answer.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.250
Every time.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.820
"Because they would have done it for me."

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.440
"Because someone else would have done the same
for me."

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.120
It is the absolute confidence

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.170
that the person to the left and 
the person to the right

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.500
would do the same for me

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.260
that gives them the courage
to do amazing things.

